  m_text: "HOW TO ESCAPE\r\n\r\n\u2022 Use the buttons to move your character.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Read the puzzle shown at the top of the room.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Walk into Door A, Door B, or Door C\r\n  to choose your answer.\r\n\r\n\u2022 You have 30 seconds to answer each puzzle.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Correct answer with 16\u201330 seconds remaining:\r\n  +200 POINTS\r\n\r\n\u2022 Correct answer with 0\u201315 seconds remaining:\r\n  +100 POINTS\r\n\r\n\u2022 A wrong answer costs 1 LIFE.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Correct answers reveal CODE DIGITS.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Remember the code digits and use them\r\n  to unlock the FINAL EXIT.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Escape before losing all 3 lives!"
